/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa,\\dot x,\\alpha,p,q,r\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa,\\dot x,\\alpha,p,q,r\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Name}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ec28b62254928d73\" href=\"?note=ec28b62254928d73\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-name.md\">../batch07/58-df-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CheckName}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CheckName}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d29823616dbc5931\" href=\"?note=d29823616dbc5931\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NiceNameForSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NiceNameForSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5NiceName}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NiceNameForSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NiceNameForSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing5NiceName}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}nice\\text{-}name\\text{-}for\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NiceNameForSubset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\kappa,\\dot x)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land\\dot x\\subseteq\\{\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\\in V\\mid\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\sigma,\\alpha,P)\\land p\\in P)\\}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in V\\;\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\Bigl((p\\neq q\\land\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\sigma,\\alpha,P)\\land\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\tau,\\alpha,P)\\land\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\\in\\dot x\\land\\langle\\tau,q\\rangle\\in\\dot x)\\to\\neg\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}nice\\text{-}name\\text{-}for\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NiceNameForSubset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\kappa,\\dot x)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_P\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_P\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Name}(\\dot x,P)\\land\\dot x\\subseteq\\{\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\\in V\\mid\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\sigma,\\alpha,P)\\land p\\in P)\\}\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in V\\;\\forall p,q\\in P\\;\\Bigl((p\\neq q\\land\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\sigma,\\alpha,P)\\land\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\tau,\\alpha,P)\\land\\langle\\sigma,p\\rangle\\in\\dot x\\land\\langle\\tau,q\\rangle\\in\\dot x)\\to\\neg\\exists r\\in P\\;(r\\leq_Pp\\land r\\leq_Pq)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}nice\\text{-}name\\text{-}for\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NiceNameForSubset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\kappa,\\dot x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NiceNameForSubset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\kappa,\\dot x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}nice\\text{-}name\\text{-}for\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing11NiceNameForSubset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\kappa,\\dot x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NiceNameForSubset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\kappa,\\dot x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}nice\\text{-}name\\text{-}for\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing5NiceName}_S(\\mathbb P,\\kappa,\\dot x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NiceNameForSubset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\kappa,\\dot x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}nice\\text{-}name\\text{-}for\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing5NiceName}_S(\\mathbb P,\\kappa,\\dot x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcForcing3NiceNameForSubset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\kappa,\\dot x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-forcing11-nice-name-for-subset</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-forcing5-nice-name</code> is merged here; it used the same antichain-by-coordinate nice-name condition.</li>\n<li>The canonical names are represented through the explicit check-name predicate, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot x\">\\(\\dot x\\)</span> is required to be a genuine <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-name.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]